WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:20.380 --> 00:22.930
In the first year of the Hongxi reign of the Ming dynasty,

3
00:22.930 --> 00:26.390
the emperor began considering moving the capital to Jinling.

4
00:26.690 --> 00:29.500
But earthquakes had been striking the city for days,

5
00:29.500 --> 00:31.630
leaving the people in a state of panic.

6
00:32.159 --> 00:34.800
Though reluctant, Crown Prince Zhu Zhanji

7
00:35.080 --> 00:38.620
had no choice but to head south at the emperor's command.

8
00:46.640 --> 00:47.500
Your Highness,

9
00:47.960 --> 00:49.560
Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou,

10
00:49.560 --> 00:51.130
has presented you with a treasure ship.

11
00:51.130 --> 00:53.980
[Crown Prince, Zhu Zhanji]

12
00:55.130 --> 01:00.930
[The Crown Prince will arrive at Jinling in three hours.]

13
01:01.200 --> 01:02.950
[Jinling City]

14
01:05.740 --> 01:08.130
[Wu Buping, Chief Constable of Yingtian Prefecture]

15
01:11.590 --> 01:13.250
[Wu Dingyuan, Constable of Yingtian Prefecture]

16
01:18.750 --> 01:19.230
Move!

17
01:19.780 --> 01:20.240
Hurry!

18
01:20.660 --> 01:21.660
Move, move, move!

19
01:23.920 --> 01:25.190
Hey, why are you stopping me?

20
01:25.190 --> 01:26.320
Go on, move to the back!

21
01:26.320 --> 01:27.720
Where am I supposed to go?

22
02:03.910 --> 02:04.910
Huliu explosive.

23
02:16.990 --> 02:17.670
Run!

24
02:18.490 --> 02:18.990
Father!

25
02:19.270 --> 02:19.870
Run!

26
02:20.490 --> 02:21.030
Hurry!

27
02:21.590 --> 02:22.450
Get out of here!

28
03:58.320 --> 04:02.260
[River of No Return]

29
04:02.300 --> 04:05.350
[Episode 1: Huliu explosive]

30
04:08.110 --> 04:09.550
Minister Shen, what do you think

31
04:09.550 --> 04:11.200
is the reason Father

32
04:11.780 --> 04:12.870
sent me to Jinling?

33
04:14.210 --> 04:15.070
Your Highness,

34
04:15.890 --> 04:17.390
Jinling has been experiencing earthquakes for days.

35
04:17.390 --> 04:19.829
His Majesty has sent you there

36
04:20.230 --> 04:21.560
to reassure the people.

37
04:22.270 --> 04:22.960
Is that so?

38
04:23.320 --> 04:25.120
Father merely sent me to Jinling

39
04:25.590 --> 04:26.970
to sound out

40
04:27.180 --> 04:28.560
the court officials

41
04:28.650 --> 04:30.980
on how they feel about moving the capital.

42
04:31.850 --> 04:33.500
What do you think the ministers' reaction

43
04:33.500 --> 04:34.820
will be?

44
04:35.120 --> 04:35.380
[Shen Lian, Official of the Eastern Palace]

45
04:35.380 --> 04:36.030
I truly

46
04:37.340 --> 04:38.870
do not know, Your Highness.

47
04:39.440 --> 04:40.640
You truly do not know?

48
04:41.890 --> 04:43.350
Without canal transport,

49
04:43.610 --> 04:45.909
what will happen to all those who depend on it for their livelihoods?

50
04:45.909 --> 04:48.909
Who will transport food and weapons to the northern frontier?

51
04:48.909 --> 04:51.080
By now, everyone in the empire knows

52
04:51.650 --> 04:53.650
that Father and I disagree on matters of state.

53
04:53.650 --> 04:54.970
I oppose moving the capital

54
04:54.970 --> 04:56.770
and have no wish to go to Jinling.

55
05:00.210 --> 05:01.390
Your Highness, please mind your words.

56
05:01.390 --> 05:03.450
Such things must never be said aloud.

57
05:05.460 --> 05:06.320
Your Highness,

58
05:06.520 --> 05:08.850
the treasure ship presented by Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou,

59
05:08.850 --> 05:10.850
has been following us all this time.

60
05:17.210 --> 05:18.210
Just look at this.

61
05:18.330 --> 05:20.550
The treasure ship presented to me by the merchant

62
05:20.550 --> 05:22.710
is even grander than the one Sanbao sailed on

63
05:22.710 --> 05:24.180
during his voyages to the Western Ocean.

64
05:24.180 --> 05:25.350
Your Highness must not accept this ship.

65
05:25.350 --> 05:26.590
Everything you see here

66
05:26.590 --> 05:29.050
was built with the people's blood and sweat,

67
05:30.060 --> 05:33.920
extracted by Yangzhou's merchants through ruthless exploitation.

68
05:36.580 --> 05:38.240
The people's blood and sweat?

69
05:42.030 --> 05:44.370
Minister Shen, I believe you are mistaken.

70
05:44.370 --> 05:46.100
Don't the functioning of the state

71
05:46.100 --> 05:47.500
and all its many expenses

72
05:47.500 --> 05:49.270
depend on the labor of the people?

73
05:49.270 --> 05:50.030
Besides,

74
05:50.440 --> 05:52.080
without goods being transported by canal from south to north,

75
05:52.080 --> 05:53.610
how would the northern armies

76
05:53.610 --> 05:54.520
get their provisions, supplies,

77
05:54.520 --> 05:55.680
and weapons?

78
05:58.850 --> 06:00.410
But His Majesty issued an explicit decree.

79
06:00.410 --> 06:01.340
Which decree?

80
06:02.060 --> 06:04.180
The people must be given time to recover and prosper.

81
06:04.180 --> 06:06.110
We must not wage war so frequently.

82
06:06.270 --> 06:08.150
Only when the people live in peace and prosperity

83
06:08.150 --> 06:09.850
can a ruler earn a place in the history books.

84
06:09.850 --> 06:10.440
Enough

85
06:11.850 --> 06:13.050
with your empty talk.

86
06:14.520 --> 06:15.390
Tell me,

87
06:16.650 --> 06:17.850
throughout history,

88
06:18.060 --> 06:19.850
which ruler earned lasting fame

89
06:19.850 --> 06:21.500
without expanding the realm

90
06:21.730 --> 06:23.710
and winning great military victories?

91
06:23.710 --> 06:24.580
Deliver my order:

92
06:24.580 --> 06:25.380
change ships.

93
06:29.580 --> 06:31.310
I'll sail on this treasure ship

94
06:31.460 --> 06:32.790
and prove it to the world

95
06:33.850 --> 06:35.330
that canal transport must continue,

96
06:35.330 --> 06:37.190
and the capital must not be moved.

97
06:53.530 --> 06:54.350
Father!

98
06:55.470 --> 06:56.390
Father!

99
06:58.940 --> 06:59.520
Father!

100
07:00.150 --> 07:01.610
Father! Are you all right?

101
07:02.000 --> 07:02.930
I'm pinned down.

102
07:02.960 --> 07:03.880
I can't get out!

103
07:06.390 --> 07:07.020
Father!

104
07:14.630 --> 07:15.160
Father.

105
07:15.770 --> 07:17.830
I thought you'd been blown to pieces!

106
07:19.650 --> 07:20.450
Constable Wu!

107
07:23.280 --> 07:24.080
Constable Wu.

108
07:24.140 --> 07:25.230
Take a head count.

109
07:25.500 --> 07:26.640
See if anyone's hurt or dead.

110
07:26.640 --> 07:27.320
Men,

111
07:27.640 --> 07:28.640
help the injured!

112
07:30.430 --> 07:31.650
I have to go to the palace.

113
07:31.650 --> 07:32.670
-Wait, Father. -I want to go to the palace.

114
07:32.670 --> 07:33.159
Father,

115
07:34.150 --> 07:36.270
why are you going to the palace at a time like this?

116
07:36.270 --> 07:38.680
Don't you understand what an explosion like this means?

117
07:38.680 --> 07:40.030
Father, I do.

118
07:41.000 --> 07:42.260
It's Huliu explosive.

119
07:42.550 --> 07:43.930
Only the palace has it.

120
07:43.970 --> 07:45.470
Father, you can't go.

121
07:45.490 --> 07:46.870
-This is way beyond us. -No.

122
07:46.870 --> 07:49.230
-We could lose our heads over this. -No, no, no.

123
07:49.230 --> 07:51.080
-No, no, no. I’ll be beheaded.

124
07:51.140 --> 07:54.470
I'll lose my head for sure if I don't get to the bottom of this.

125
08:02.270 --> 08:03.270
Come on, get out.

126
08:07.330 --> 08:08.390
Come on, it's okay.

127
08:09.390 --> 08:10.120
Take it slow.

128
08:13.410 --> 08:13.960
Let's go.

129
08:14.120 --> 08:14.680
Careful.

130
08:17.700 --> 08:18.630
Watch your head.

131
08:33.090 --> 08:33.799
Watch out.

132
08:47.460 --> 08:48.440
Did you steal it?

133
08:49.040 --> 08:49.850
I didn't steal it!

134
08:49.850 --> 08:51.380
Are you going to talk or not?

135
08:51.730 --> 08:52.870
It wasn't me!

136
08:53.230 --> 08:54.280
It wasn't me!

137
08:54.960 --> 08:56.110
Are you going to talk or not?

138
08:56.110 --> 08:56.660
Are you going to talk or not?

139
08:56.660 --> 08:58.190
Are you going to talk or not?

140
08:59.510 --> 09:00.460
Are you going to talk or not?

141
09:00.460 --> 09:01.200
Constable Wu,

142
09:01.200 --> 09:02.440
didn't you have urgent business?

143
09:02.440 --> 09:03.130
Stop gawking

144
09:03.130 --> 09:03.930
and get going.

145
09:06.870 --> 09:07.600
Eunuch Qing,

146
09:07.820 --> 09:09.610
has something gone missing from the palace lately?

147
09:09.610 --> 09:10.900
What's all this chaos about?

148
09:10.900 --> 09:12.560
It's been a mess for a long time.

149
09:12.560 --> 09:14.680
Ever since Emperor Taizong moved the capital to Beijing,

150
09:14.680 --> 09:15.530
there's been no order

151
09:15.530 --> 09:16.310
in Jinling.

152
09:16.360 --> 09:17.890
And after the earthquakes,

153
09:18.090 --> 09:19.820
things have only gotten worse.

154
09:21.110 --> 09:22.110
Spare me, Eunuch!

155
09:22.110 --> 09:23.990
The earthquake caused the warehouse to collapse,

156
09:23.990 --> 09:25.710
and the thieves took advantage of the chaos.

157
09:25.710 --> 09:27.060
It really was a natural disaster, Eunuch!

158
09:27.060 --> 09:28.580
Please investigate this fairly, Eunuch!

159
09:28.580 --> 09:29.560
You call this

160
09:29.870 --> 09:31.580
a collapse caused by the earthquake?

161
09:31.580 --> 09:33.280
All you do is lie. Come here.

162
09:34.210 --> 09:35.810
Twist his tongue into a rope!

163
09:36.090 --> 09:36.630
Come with me!

164
09:36.630 --> 09:37.630
Eunuch, I...

165
09:39.080 --> 09:39.590
Move!

166
09:42.210 --> 09:42.680
Lord Zheng,

167
09:42.680 --> 09:45.110
Wu Buping, chief constable of the three divisions of Yingtian Prefecture, is here.

168
09:45.110 --> 09:46.210
[Zheng He, Eunuch in Charge of Defense]

169
09:46.210 --> 09:47.990
The Huliu explosive must be inspected daily,

170
09:47.990 --> 09:49.920
and two sixth-rank officials

171
09:49.920 --> 09:51.730
must review the ledgers together.

172
09:51.730 --> 09:55.330
Then two clerks must open the crates and inspect their contents.

173
09:56.250 --> 09:59.080
These were the rules laid down by Emperor Taizong.

174
09:59.280 --> 10:00.080
How could...

175
10:00.100 --> 10:01.300
-Eunuch Zheng. -Yes.

176
10:01.370 --> 10:03.680
When Emperor Taizong established those rules,

177
10:03.680 --> 10:05.340
Jinling was still the capital.

178
10:05.340 --> 10:06.920
These days, we should be grateful

179
10:06.920 --> 10:07.610
if inspections happen once every five days.

180
10:07.610 --> 10:08.340
How dare you!

181
10:09.160 --> 10:09.940
Eunuch Zheng asked you a question.

182
10:09.940 --> 10:10.870
Answer him honestly.

183
10:10.870 --> 10:11.200
Yes.

184
10:11.230 --> 10:12.580
How dare you make such presumptuous remarks?

185
10:12.580 --> 10:13.680
So you're

186
10:14.200 --> 10:15.840
Wu Buping, the Iron Lion?

187
10:16.020 --> 10:16.680
Lord Zheng,

188
10:17.160 --> 10:18.040
I've heard

189
10:18.640 --> 10:21.260
there's no case in Jinling you can't crack.

190
10:21.540 --> 10:22.280
Lord Zheng,

191
10:22.300 --> 10:23.730
that's just my colleagues at the prefectural office

192
10:23.730 --> 10:24.730
talking nonsense.

193
10:24.730 --> 10:25.780
You shouldn't take it seriously.

194
10:25.780 --> 10:26.760
Get to the point.

195
10:27.850 --> 10:28.770
Two hours earlier,

196
10:28.770 --> 10:30.230
at a home on a street outside the city,

197
10:30.230 --> 10:31.360
gunpowder ignited.

198
10:31.440 --> 10:32.750
The blast was far too powerful

199
10:32.750 --> 10:35.150
to have been caused by ordinary gunpowder.

200
10:35.200 --> 10:36.930
Our preliminary assessment is

201
10:37.130 --> 10:40.590
that it was most likely Huliu explosive, which is only kept in the palace.

202
10:40.590 --> 10:42.650
How much Huliu explosive is missing?

203
10:43.720 --> 10:45.780
How much Huliu explosive is missing?

204
10:48.320 --> 10:49.120
Eunuch Zheng,

205
10:49.280 --> 10:50.230
this inventory sheet

206
10:50.230 --> 10:51.200
is still being checked.

207
10:51.200 --> 10:52.850
Can you determine when it went missing?

208
10:52.850 --> 10:53.540
[Zhu Buhua, Chief Eunuch of the Imperial Horse Bureau]

209
10:53.540 --> 10:55.200
If I knew when it went missing,

210
10:55.600 --> 10:56.400
what would I need you for?

211
10:56.400 --> 10:57.040
Shut up!

212
10:58.460 --> 10:59.110
Yes.

213
11:03.680 --> 11:04.480
Constable Wu,

214
11:05.210 --> 11:06.230
I'll have someone

215
11:06.470 --> 11:07.630
prepare a list of all eunuchs, officials,

216
11:07.630 --> 11:09.900
and craftsmen who entered or left

217
11:09.900 --> 11:11.680
the Imperial City in the past five days.

218
11:11.680 --> 11:12.550
Don't bother sleeping.

219
11:12.550 --> 11:13.800
Investigate through the night.

220
11:13.800 --> 11:14.630
Lord Zheng,

221
11:15.470 --> 11:17.300
should I investigate the people or the missing items?

222
11:17.300 --> 11:19.760
You must investigate the people, of course.

223
11:20.290 --> 11:21.640
But more importantly,

224
11:22.360 --> 11:24.160
you must uncover the plot

225
11:24.390 --> 11:26.720
behind the theft of the Huliu explosives.

226
11:28.670 --> 11:29.710
Yes, yes.

227
11:32.180 --> 11:34.010
Where is the Crown Prince's imperial vessel now?

228
11:34.010 --> 11:34.810
Eunuch Zheng,

229
11:35.250 --> 11:36.350
the Crown Prince's imperial vessel

230
11:36.350 --> 11:39.550
should reach the Dongshuiguan Wharf in about four hours.

231
11:39.930 --> 11:41.730
With the Huliu explosive stolen

232
11:43.600 --> 11:45.450
at such a critical moment,

233
11:48.730 --> 11:50.640
I pray

234
11:52.210 --> 11:53.630
the Crown Prince isn't the target.

235
11:53.630 --> 11:55.250
By order of the Crown Prince:

236
11:55.550 --> 11:58.290
accept the treasure ship offered by Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou.

237
11:58.290 --> 12:00.080
Canal transport is the lifeblood of the state.

238
12:00.080 --> 12:01.590
The Crown Prince shall board this ship to make this known to the realm.

239
12:01.590 --> 12:02.630
♪ The Golden Hall stands grand and wide ♪

240
12:02.630 --> 12:03.780
Change the boat.

241
12:03.870 --> 12:06.310
♪ Towers shrouded deep in clouds and mist ♪

242
12:06.340 --> 12:08.580
♪ They call me the Crown Prince ♪

243
12:08.880 --> 12:11.190
♪ But I hide by the Qinhuai River ♪

244
12:16.260 --> 12:18.740
♪ Those high in court know nothing of the world below ♪

245
12:18.770 --> 12:21.170
♪ The storms outside are just tales to them ♪

246
12:21.200 --> 12:23.710
♪ Take off this robe, and I'm just a stranger ♪

247
12:26.280 --> 12:30.740
♪ Across a thousand mountains, a thousand miles, I'll fight ♪

248
13:19.490 --> 13:20.290
Constable Wu?

249
13:21.680 --> 13:22.480
Constable Wu?

250
13:23.450 --> 13:24.250
Constable Wu.

251
13:25.430 --> 13:26.160
Eunuch Qing.

252
13:26.490 --> 13:27.470
So this is how you lot

253
13:27.470 --> 13:28.320
do your work?

254
13:28.680 --> 13:29.740
What a filthy mess!

255
13:29.970 --> 13:31.900
Thank you, thank you, Eunuch Qing.

256
13:36.860 --> 13:38.980
Ordinary craftsmen and conscripted laborers

257
13:38.980 --> 13:41.160
are all thoroughly searched whenever they enter or leave the Imperial City.

258
13:41.160 --> 13:43.580
The only people who can come and go freely without being searched

259
13:43.580 --> 13:44.440
are officials.

260
13:44.800 --> 13:46.080
And among all the officials,

261
13:46.080 --> 13:47.230
only those four who travel by sedan chair

262
13:47.230 --> 13:48.680
could have smuggled out an entire barrel of Huliu explosive.

263
13:48.680 --> 13:49.470
Eunuch Qing,

264
13:49.610 --> 13:50.930
we can't investigate the officials.

265
13:50.930 --> 13:51.500
Why not?

266
13:51.680 --> 13:53.500
Because we have no authority to summon them for questioning.

267
13:53.500 --> 13:56.110
All we can do is investigate their sedan chair bearers.

268
13:56.110 --> 13:58.090
Father, what good would that do?

269
13:58.380 --> 14:01.180
The bearers have most likely already been bribed.

270
14:01.510 --> 14:02.490
Wouldn't an investigation

271
14:02.490 --> 14:03.680
just tip them off?

272
14:04.300 --> 14:05.110
If we're going to investigate anyone,

273
14:05.110 --> 14:06.960
it has to be those four officials.

274
14:06.960 --> 14:08.360
Investigate officials?

275
14:10.200 --> 14:11.230
Eunuch Qing knows the procedure.

276
14:11.230 --> 14:14.040
First, you gather evidence from the outside,

277
14:14.180 --> 14:15.160
submit a sworn report,

278
14:15.160 --> 14:16.460
and then forward it to the relevant government office.

279
14:16.460 --> 14:18.060
Its chief then decides whether to refer the case

280
14:18.060 --> 14:21.520
to the Provincial Surveillance Commission or the Censorate.

281
14:21.540 --> 14:22.270
Eunuch Qing,

282
14:22.800 --> 14:24.630
Lord Zheng has given me only 24 hours.

283
14:24.630 --> 14:25.440
Lord Zheng's business...

284
14:25.440 --> 14:27.330
I can't get involved in Lord Zheng's business.

285
14:27.330 --> 14:29.110
I... I'm afraid I won't even have time

286
14:29.110 --> 14:30.370
to draft the memorial.

287
14:30.610 --> 14:31.160
Father,

288
14:31.820 --> 14:34.020
I know who we should investigate first.

289
14:34.420 --> 14:35.040
This man.

290
14:37.660 --> 14:38.600
[Guo Zhimin, Investigating Censor of the Guangdong Circuit]

291
14:38.600 --> 14:39.230
Why him?

292
14:39.700 --> 14:40.360
This man...

293
14:40.900 --> 14:42.320
His home is the closest.

294
15:10.120 --> 15:12.420
[Guo Zhimin, Investigating Censor]

295
15:30.040 --> 15:31.060
The deceased is Guo Zhimin,

296
15:31.060 --> 15:32.190
a native of Yangzhou

297
15:32.200 --> 15:33.830
who served as an Investigating Censor for the Guangdong Circuit.

298
15:33.830 --> 15:35.350
He only recently arrived in Jinling.

299
15:35.350 --> 15:36.800
He had two servants: a doorkeeper

300
15:36.800 --> 15:38.590
and a maid who did the laundry and cooking.

301
15:38.590 --> 15:38.700
[Laoliu, Constable of Yingtian Prefecture]

302
15:38.700 --> 15:39.090
Oh,

303
15:39.180 --> 15:40.310
and he had a fiancée,

304
15:40.330 --> 15:41.810
but she didn't live with him.

305
15:41.810 --> 15:43.780
Last night, Guo Zhimin went out to visit someone.

306
15:43.780 --> 15:45.080
He wasn't feeling well when he returned,

307
15:45.080 --> 15:45.830
so he took some medicine

308
15:45.830 --> 15:46.890
and retired early.

309
15:47.300 --> 15:49.210
When the earthquake struck, the doorkeeper and the maid fled outside.

310
15:49.210 --> 15:50.340
When they returned,

311
15:50.640 --> 15:52.830
the maid was the first to discover the body.

312
15:52.830 --> 15:53.750
In a panic,

313
15:54.000 --> 15:56.420
the doorkeeper immediately reported the death to the authorities.

314
15:56.420 --> 16:03.240
♪ Though wronged by men, I'll stand by what's right ♪

315
16:09.610 --> 16:10.940
The footprints have been examined.

316
16:10.940 --> 16:11.940
Only three people left footprints: Guo Zhimin,

317
16:11.940 --> 16:13.600
the doorkeeper, and the maid.

318
16:14.740 --> 16:16.240
Judging by the scene,

319
16:16.630 --> 16:18.640
the bloodstains, the injuries,

320
16:19.280 --> 16:20.830
and the state of the body,

321
16:21.230 --> 16:22.350
it appears that Censor Guo died

322
16:22.350 --> 16:24.110
when the earthquake caused

323
16:24.760 --> 16:26.020
the house to collapse.

324
16:28.060 --> 16:29.340
Once the coroner finishes the examination,

325
16:29.340 --> 16:31.270
we should be able to close the case.

326
16:33.210 --> 16:34.070
What a tragedy.

327
16:47.180 --> 16:49.730
[Su Jingxi]

328
16:51.290 --> 16:58.300
[One Hour Until the Crown Prince Arrives in Jinling]

329
17:12.510 --> 17:13.339
Your Highness,

330
17:13.339 --> 17:13.980
the treasure ship

331
17:13.980 --> 17:16.640
will reach the Dongshuiguan Wharf before noon.

332
17:18.250 --> 17:19.030
Once ashore,

333
17:19.250 --> 17:20.200
Lord Zheng He

334
17:20.290 --> 17:22.550
will personally escort Your Highness back to the palace.

335
17:22.550 --> 17:23.599
After a brief rest,

336
17:23.599 --> 17:25.930
I'll send an order to relieve the victims.

337
17:32.460 --> 17:34.790
Tomorrow, at the auspicious hour selected by the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

338
17:34.790 --> 17:37.300
Your Highness will pay tribute to the Hongwu Emperor at Xiaoling Mausoleum.

339
17:37.300 --> 17:38.780
The day after,

340
17:39.110 --> 17:40.460
Your Highness will receive the officials at Fengtian Hall at 7:45 AM.

341
17:40.460 --> 17:41.900
[Wang Daban, Eunuch of the Eastern Palace]

342
17:41.900 --> 17:46.360
That afternoon, Your Highness will inspect the disaster zone south of the city.

343
17:46.600 --> 17:47.380
Got it.

344
17:48.710 --> 17:50.910
We can discuss it after we reach Jinling

345
17:50.920 --> 17:52.090
and meet Sanbao.

346
17:53.010 --> 17:53.960
Anything else?

347
17:59.400 --> 18:00.270
Your Highness,

348
18:00.570 --> 18:03.570
Sai Zilong's wings are half a finger's breadth apart.

349
18:03.620 --> 18:05.310
It's constantly fluttering its wings—

350
18:05.310 --> 18:06.400
ready to fight.

351
18:12.050 --> 18:12.940
Eunuch Wang,

352
18:13.860 --> 18:17.310
you're the only one aboard who understands this little pleasure of mine.

353
18:17.310 --> 18:18.200
A pity

354
18:20.180 --> 18:21.710
that once we reach Jinling,

355
18:21.860 --> 18:23.570
I won't have the leisure for such things.

356
18:23.570 --> 18:26.500
Your Highness can make time for it whenever you wish.

357
18:34.270 --> 18:35.230
Go on!

358
18:36.490 --> 18:37.350
Your Highness.

359
18:38.210 --> 18:38.860
Your Highness.

360
18:38.860 --> 18:40.060
Keep your voice down.

361
18:40.360 --> 18:41.560
All right, all right.

362
18:41.860 --> 18:42.720
Your Highness,

363
18:42.990 --> 18:45.490
shall we change into your ceremonial robes first?

364
18:45.490 --> 18:46.420
What's the rush?

365
18:47.200 --> 18:48.120
One more round.

366
18:48.810 --> 18:50.270
All right, one more round.

367
18:50.840 --> 18:51.700
Your Highness,

368
18:52.120 --> 18:53.900
what's the fun of watching crickets on this ship?

369
18:53.900 --> 18:55.250
They're just here to pass the time.

370
18:55.250 --> 18:56.510
Once we reach Jinling,

371
18:57.380 --> 18:58.550
we'll have Huajing crickets,

372
18:58.550 --> 18:59.710
Giant crickets,

373
19:00.070 --> 19:01.160
Huangling crickets—

374
19:01.160 --> 19:02.790
every kind of cricket you could want!

375
19:02.790 --> 19:04.050
Right, Your Highness?

376
19:04.180 --> 19:06.360
You'll get to watch even better ones, Your Highness.

377
19:06.360 --> 19:07.690
Do you think I'm a child?

378
19:12.570 --> 19:13.030
Bite it!

379
19:13.250 --> 19:14.180
Come on, bite it!

380
19:22.290 --> 19:23.150
Your Highness.

381
19:25.270 --> 19:26.200
Your Highness.

382
19:30.250 --> 19:31.440
Your Highness.

383
19:34.750 --> 19:36.030
If you don't change now,

384
19:36.030 --> 19:37.230
we'll be late.

385
19:38.210 --> 19:40.140
All right, all right! I'll change!

386
19:40.680 --> 19:41.410
So annoying.

387
19:43.210 --> 19:44.670
Thank you, Your Highness.

388
19:45.210 --> 19:46.470
Where is my Sai Zilong?

389
19:46.760 --> 19:47.790
Stop fooling around!

390
19:47.790 --> 19:48.920
Yes, Your Highness.

391
19:55.010 --> 19:58.430
[Li Yong, Guard of the Eastern Palace]

392
20:06.770 --> 20:07.570
Constable Wu,

393
20:07.570 --> 20:08.890
there's news from the prefectural office.

394
20:08.890 --> 20:12.290
The Crown Prince's ship has entered the Outer Qinhuai River.

395
20:14.360 --> 20:14.920
Fall in!

396
20:17.880 --> 20:19.710
The Crown Prince is coming to Jinling.

397
20:19.710 --> 20:21.090
From the Earl of Xiangcheng

398
20:21.090 --> 20:23.350
to the heads of every government office,

399
20:23.420 --> 20:25.350
all must go to Dongshuiguan Wharf to welcome the Crown Prince.

400
20:25.350 --> 20:26.450
And after last night's earthquake,

401
20:26.450 --> 20:27.910
the city is still in chaos.

402
20:28.810 --> 20:31.970
The officials at the garrison yamen have issued strict orders.

403
20:31.970 --> 20:33.900
Everyone listed on the duty roster

404
20:33.940 --> 20:36.620
must stand guard along the streets, unless they're dead.

405
20:36.620 --> 20:38.530
Not even a mosquito is to get through on the road

406
20:38.530 --> 20:40.790
from Dongshuiguan Wharf to the Imperial City.

407
20:40.790 --> 20:41.520
Understood?

408
20:41.620 --> 20:42.530
Understood!

409
20:44.140 --> 20:44.710
Let's go.

410
20:44.810 --> 20:45.360
Move out!

411
20:45.600 --> 20:46.230
Hurry up!

412
20:46.990 --> 20:47.720
Wu Dingyuan,

413
20:47.850 --> 20:49.910
you're assigned to guard Shangutai.

414
20:52.300 --> 20:54.500
Shangutai? That's a cushy assignment.

415
20:54.620 --> 20:55.490
Sure is.

416
20:55.870 --> 20:56.730
At this hour, it's scorching hot

417
20:56.730 --> 20:58.930
at Shangutai. That good-for-nothing

418
20:59.050 --> 21:00.090
will melt in the sun.

419
21:00.090 --> 21:01.710
Constable Wu really doesn't seem

420
21:01.710 --> 21:02.780
to care about his own son.

421
21:02.780 --> 21:03.580
That's right.

422
21:04.510 --> 21:05.730
He's sending us to Dongshuiguan Wharf

423
21:05.730 --> 21:07.000
to welcome the Crown Prince in grand style,

424
21:07.000 --> 21:08.510
while his own son has been assigned

425
21:08.510 --> 21:09.950
to the toughest post.

426
21:11.350 --> 21:12.480
What's he thinking?

427
21:12.770 --> 21:13.470
Who knows?

428
21:14.440 --> 21:15.440
Come on, let's go.

429
21:17.050 --> 21:18.510
Take your time eating, Wu.

430
21:19.620 --> 21:20.190
You...

431
21:22.160 --> 21:27.070
[One Hour Until the Crown Prince Arrives in Jinling]

432
21:37.340 --> 21:41.250
♪ Those high in court know nothing of the world below ♪

433
21:41.320 --> 21:45.320
♪ The storms outside are just tales to them ♪

434
21:45.450 --> 21:47.180
♪ Take off this robe, and I'm just a stranger ♪

435
21:47.180 --> 21:48.040
Your Highness!

436
21:48.920 --> 21:49.490
Your Highness.

437
21:49.490 --> 21:50.250
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

438
21:50.250 --> 21:51.970
Please, stay away from the side of the ship.

439
21:51.970 --> 21:53.210
If you fall overboard, I could

440
21:53.210 --> 21:57.070
never atone for such a grave offense, even if I died a thousand deaths!

441
21:58.330 --> 21:58.920
Li Yong,

442
21:59.470 --> 22:01.140
this treasure ship displaces 1,500 tons.

443
22:01.140 --> 22:02.290
With no wind or waves,

444
22:02.290 --> 22:04.110
how could a mere river make it sway?

445
22:04.110 --> 22:05.340
I'm not trying to criticize you,

446
22:05.340 --> 22:07.000
but you really know so little!

447
22:07.530 --> 22:07.990
Yes.

448
22:08.230 --> 22:08.680
Yes.

449
22:09.060 --> 22:10.130
Where's my Sai Zilong?

450
22:10.130 --> 22:10.810
It's gone!

451
22:26.180 --> 22:27.550
When the ship reaches Dongshuiguan Wharf,

452
22:27.550 --> 22:29.040
use fireworks as the signal.

453
22:29.040 --> 22:30.700
Light the fuse upon seeing it.

454
22:51.030 --> 22:51.750
Li Yong.

455
22:53.010 --> 22:53.870
Your Highness!

456
22:55.100 --> 22:55.960
Your Highness.

457
22:56.230 --> 22:58.070
Are these fireworks along the way

458
22:58.070 --> 22:59.200
to welcome me?

459
23:00.770 --> 23:01.930
Your Highness is absolutely right.

460
23:01.930 --> 23:03.940
The prefectures and counties have prepared them in accordance with court protocol.

461
23:03.940 --> 23:05.270
That must be the reason.

462
23:09.360 --> 23:11.300
From Yangzhou all the way to Jinling,

463
23:11.300 --> 23:13.430
there have been fireworks everywhere.

464
23:13.430 --> 23:16.290
Don't you think that's an excessive waste of money?

465
23:16.550 --> 23:17.670
Your Highness's virtue

466
23:17.670 --> 23:18.670
is admired by all.

467
23:19.160 --> 23:20.010
The fireworks are merely

468
23:20.010 --> 23:22.670
a small token of their regard for Your Highness.

469
23:32.970 --> 23:33.710
Is that so?

470
23:52.610 --> 23:56.890
[Dongshui Pass]

471
24:58.990 --> 24:59.850
Your Highness,

472
24:59.850 --> 25:01.640
now that you've caught it, hurry and change into your ceremonial robes.

473
25:01.640 --> 25:03.700
We're almost at Dongshuiguan Wharf.

474
25:10.950 --> 25:12.410
You little rascal!

475
25:13.700 --> 25:14.710
Your Highness,

476
25:14.880 --> 25:16.940
everyone on shore is waiting for you!

477
26:35.850 --> 26:36.660
Lord Li,

478
26:37.230 --> 26:37.470
it's not the Crown Prince's imperial vessel, is it?

479
26:37.470 --> 26:39.850
[Defense Earl of Xiangcheng, Li Long]

480
26:39.850 --> 26:40.590
Lord Zheng,

481
26:40.680 --> 26:41.790
we just learned

482
26:42.380 --> 26:44.140
that His Highness transferred

483
26:44.200 --> 26:46.770
to a treasure ship in Yangzhou, gifted by Wang Ji, a merchant.

484
26:46.770 --> 26:48.460
A ship gifted by a merchant?

485
26:49.250 --> 26:51.380
Where are His Highness's attendants?

486
26:51.510 --> 26:53.430
How could they allow the Crown Prince to so flagrantly

487
26:53.430 --> 26:55.630
overstep the prescribed rules of rank?

488
27:00.070 --> 27:00.930
Your Highness,

489
27:01.180 --> 27:02.780
everyone's waiting for you.

490
27:02.820 --> 27:04.260
If they don't want to wait,

491
27:04.260 --> 27:05.310
they can leave.

492
27:05.510 --> 27:06.440
Besides,

493
27:06.820 --> 27:08.100
let them wait if they want to.

494
27:08.100 --> 27:09.190
What's the rush?

495
29:32.350 --> 29:33.380
Run!

496
29:42.190 --> 29:43.060
Your Highness!

497
29:43.290 --> 29:44.380
My Lord! My Lord!

498
35:11.720 --> 35:12.400
Go on, run!

499
35:20.490 --> 35:21.750
You little scoundrel!

500
35:26.380 --> 35:27.040
Go on, run!

501
35:28.110 --> 35:29.640
Aren't you good at running?

502
35:47.570 --> 35:48.240
Envoy,

503
35:48.630 --> 35:49.650
[Lord of Iron Alliance Yesterday Ye He]

504
35:49.650 --> 35:51.400
the nobleman above us has ordered us

505
35:51.400 --> 35:53.460
to kill the Crown Prince at all costs.

506
35:53.770 --> 35:54.380
[Iron Alliance He Si]

507
35:54.380 --> 35:55.300
But after that explosion,

508
35:55.300 --> 35:56.050
everything's in chaos.

509
35:56.050 --> 35:57.380
We can't tell who's who.

510
35:58.070 --> 35:59.440
How are we supposed to know which one is the Crown Prince

511
35:59.440 --> 36:00.340
and which one isn't?

512
36:00.340 --> 36:00.950
Shut up.

513
36:03.390 --> 36:05.770
Send 12 men downstream to hunt him down.

514
36:06.210 --> 36:08.270
The Crown Prince must die in Jinling.

515
36:08.630 --> 36:09.150
Yes!

516
36:09.820 --> 36:10.420
Come back.

517
36:11.920 --> 36:13.400
Find a few more sharp men

518
36:13.800 --> 36:15.990
and send them to search Shangutai,

519
36:15.990 --> 36:18.590
Zhuquehang, and Taoyedu, all downstream from Dongshuiguan.

520
36:18.590 --> 36:19.070
Yes.

521
36:28.470 --> 36:29.270
Hold on tight.

522
37:07.610 --> 37:08.360
Lord Zheng.

523
37:10.450 --> 37:11.110
Lord Zheng.

524
37:13.030 --> 37:14.110
Why are you so late?

525
37:14.230 --> 37:15.650
It all happened so suddenly.

526
37:15.650 --> 37:16.280
Tell me,

527
37:16.620 --> 37:17.560
was the ship

528
37:18.070 --> 37:19.360
blown up

529
37:19.530 --> 37:22.320
with Huliu explosive, the same kind stolen from the palace?

530
37:22.320 --> 37:23.050
Yes.

531
37:23.780 --> 37:25.800
But the Huliu explosive stolen from the palace

532
37:25.800 --> 37:27.170
was only stolen 5 days ago.

533
37:27.170 --> 37:28.350
How could anyone have had time

534
37:28.350 --> 37:31.210
to hide it aboard the Crown Prince's treasure ship?

535
37:35.000 --> 37:36.000
Then tell me,

536
37:37.120 --> 37:39.490
who exactly blew up the Crown Prince's ship?

537
37:39.490 --> 37:40.980
Where did the Huliu explosive come from,

538
37:40.980 --> 37:43.530
and how did it end up aboard the Crown Prince's ship?

539
37:43.530 --> 37:44.360
Well, I...

540
37:44.880 --> 37:46.210
I'm not sure about that.

541
37:47.670 --> 37:49.630
I asked you to investigate the Huliu explosive case.

542
37:49.630 --> 37:51.190
What have you found out?

543
37:51.530 --> 37:52.670
L-Lord Zheng,

544
37:52.990 --> 37:54.620
the culprit has been one step

545
37:55.030 --> 37:56.780
ahead of us in both the bombing

546
37:57.130 --> 37:58.720
at that house and Lord Guo Zhimin's death.

547
37:58.720 --> 37:59.970
Every time we get a lead, it goes cold.

548
37:59.970 --> 38:00.670
Shut up!

549
38:03.190 --> 38:05.050
It's too late to say anything now.

550
38:05.610 --> 38:07.270
I-I'll go investigate again.

551
38:08.160 --> 38:10.360
We'll just have to wait to be impeached.

552
38:17.440 --> 38:18.590
You scoundrel.

553
38:19.760 --> 38:21.240
Did you know in advance that the ship

554
38:21.240 --> 38:22.240
would be blown up?

555
39:32.130 --> 39:32.840
Sirs,

556
39:34.170 --> 39:35.800
this is the scoundrel I caught.

557
39:35.800 --> 39:38.600
He was about to be sent to the Yingtian Prefecture.

558
39:38.810 --> 39:40.940
I'd appreciate it if you'd let us pass.

559
39:41.110 --> 39:42.240
Are you the constable

560
39:42.240 --> 39:43.740
The constable on duty

561
39:44.070 --> 39:44.670
Yes, I am.

562
39:45.450 --> 39:47.250
Why are you in such a sorry state?

563
39:49.030 --> 39:50.390
I figured I could turn him

564
39:50.390 --> 39:52.690
in and collect a reward.

565
39:53.340 --> 39:54.760
I didn't expect the scoundrel

566
39:54.760 --> 39:55.920
to know a thing or two about fighting.

567
39:55.920 --> 39:58.050
He ended up dragging me into the river.

568
39:58.330 --> 39:59.190
What rotten luck.

569
39:59.190 --> 40:00.310
It sure is.

570
40:00.880 --> 40:02.470
Do you need our help?

571
40:49.940 --> 40:51.080
Give me your wine.

572
40:52.210 --> 40:53.000
I saved you,

573
40:54.540 --> 40:55.800
so you should thank me.

574
41:46.410 --> 41:47.110
Tell me,

575
41:48.050 --> 41:49.320
how did you figure out

576
41:49.660 --> 41:51.660
those two soldiers were impostors?

577
42:02.360 --> 42:03.090
Their boots.

578
42:04.580 --> 42:05.620
Soldiers on duty

579
42:06.630 --> 42:08.430
wouldn't wear brand-new boots.

580
42:08.520 --> 42:10.050
They'd give them blisters.

581
42:13.030 --> 42:14.160
You know quite a bit,

582
42:14.800 --> 42:16.860
and you're pretty skilled in combat.

583
42:17.110 --> 42:20.170
You're a military officer serving the Crown Prince, aren't you?

584
42:20.170 --> 42:21.300
Who are you, really?

585
42:26.910 --> 42:29.020
I'm asking you. Who are you?

586
42:33.430 --> 42:34.360
Don't follow me.

587
42:58.950 --> 43:01.610
So that's why you were giving me such a hard time.

588
43:02.710 --> 43:04.170
You've got quite a temper.

589
43:04.760 --> 43:05.950
All your moves are dirty tricks.
